{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05006","headline":"初达驩州 · 沈佺期","name":"初达驩州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流子一十八，命予偏不偶。\n配远天遂穷，到迟日最後。\n水行儋耳国，陆行雕题薮。\n魂魄游鬼门，骸骨遗鲸口。\n夜则忍饥卧，朝则抱病走。\n搔首向南荒，拭泪看北斗。\n何年赦书来？重饮洛阳酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}